      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.19310",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We give an elementary, Fourier-free proof of Roth’s theorem. The proof follows Roth’s original density-increment strategy, but replaces the usual Fourier-analytic step with a direct combinatorial argument involving averages over sub-progressions.",
